    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπιστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>entrust</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.67
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phoc.</u>
				32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως ταῖς βολαῖς τῶν ὀμμάτων ἐ.
					τὴν τόξευσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Descr.</u>
					30.8
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PStrassb.</u>
					5.10
				</span></i>
			; but also, <i>to be entrusted with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Demon.</u>
				51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.44.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐγκέφαλος . . ἀσφάλειαν
					ἐμπεπιστευμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trust in, give credence to</i>, 
