					LXX
					<u>De.</u>
					1.32
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				130.19
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ch.</u>
					20.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
